Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Title,,0,0,0,,Start
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.72,0:00:14.80,Na,,0,0,0,,亲爱的观众朋友们 女士们先生们
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.96,0:00:16.74,Na,,0,0,0,,以及各位尊贵的来宾们
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.16,0:00:22.60,Na,,0,0,0,,欢迎来到"永远都是好朋友！"双人演唱会！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.72,0:00:25.52,Na,,0,0,0,,由高槻弥生和水濑伊织联袂出演！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.18,0:00:29.42,Na,,0,0,0,,稍等片刻 璀璨的灯光即将绽放 动人的旋律即将响起
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.54,0:00:32.98,Na,,0,0,0,,一段温馨的友情故事即将生动呈现
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.14,0:00:35.52,Na,,0,0,0,,现在请深呼吸 绽放笑容 做好准备
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.52,0:00:37.48,Na,,0,0,0,,迎接这场精彩绝伦的梦幻之旅
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.80,0:00:40.72,Na,,0,0,0,,因为这场奇妙的冒险 现在正式开始！
Comment: 0,0:00:54.00,0:00:59.00,Title,,0,0,0,,STORY
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.75,0:00:59.67,Na,,0,0,0,,很久很久以前  有一个名为阳光之国的王国
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.37,0:01:08.83,Na,,0,0,0,,王国里住着一位如宝石般璀璨夺目的公主
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.87,0:01:16.21,Na,,0,0,0,,公主居住在一座被白金高塔环绕的城堡里
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.47,0:01:18.43,Na,,0,0,0,,自幼便备受呵护地成长
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.11,0:01:27.71,Na,,0,0,0,,然而  这般生活却如同身处华美的牢笼
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.43,0:01:34.07,Na,,0,0,0,,即便是城墙外的清风  她也无法伸手触碰
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.01,0:01:41.17,Na,,0,0,0,,她内心渴望能在外奔跑  与朋友一同欢笑
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.61,0:01:45.99,Na,,0,0,0,,但她却总是必须挺直背脊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.93,0:01:48.95,Na,,0,0,0,,只能日复一日地默默地凝望着窗外
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.83,0:01:55.49,Na,,0,0,0,,城堡的山脚下  有一个名为阳光小镇的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.03,0:01:59.81,Na,,0,0,0,,有一条熙熙攘攘的街道
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.19,0:02:03.73,Na,,0,0,0,,那里住着一位并不富有的女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.31,0:02:05.59,Na,,0,0,0,,却终日奔跑嬉戏
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.03,0:02:10.39,Na,,0,0,0,,是个自由奔放、天真烂漫的城镇姑娘
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.21,0:02:18.11,Na,,0,0,0,,这位姑娘在蓝天下放声歌唱、开怀大笑
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.69,0:02:20.73,Na,,0,0,0,,她最懂得如何发现生活中的幸福
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.39,0:02:29.45,Na,,0,0,0,,公主每日都从城堡高高的窗户俯视着这条街道
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.77,0:02:34.65,Na,,0,0,0,,人们的欢声笑语  孩子们的追逐打闹
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.11,0:02:40.53,Na,,0,0,0,,而在那之中  有一个身影显得格外耀眼夺目——
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.37,0:02:44.59,Na,,0,0,0,,一位摇曳着橙色长发的少女
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.27,0:02:51.87,Na,,0,0,0,,小镇姑娘每日倚窗遥望城堡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.33,0:02:57.05,Na,,0,0,0,,憧憬着那里的奢华生活  仿佛能闻到佳肴的香气
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.19,0:03:01.25,Na,,0,0,0,,而其中最耀眼夺目的——
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.79,0:03:03.71,Na,,0,0,0,,是那位身着粉色礼服的少女
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.67,0:03:11.59,Na,,0,0,0,,某天  她们终于鼓起勇气向彼此搭话
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.35,0:03:16.11,Na,,0,0,0,,好像你一样绽放笑颜
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.87,0:03:20.61,Na,,0,0,0,,好像你一样熠熠生辉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.39,0:03:24.77,Na,,0,0,0,,公主闻言嫣然一笑：
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.69,0:03:28.39,Na,,0,0,0,,那我们一起去吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.47,0:03:34.77,Na,,0,0,0,,那天  公主生平第一次溜出了城堡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.25,0:03:38.57,Na,,0,0,0,,小镇姑娘牵着公主的手
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.97,0:03:41.59,Na,,0,0,0,,走向森林深处  只见五彩花瓣
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.59,0:03:43.71,Na,,0,0,0,,装点成一座缤纷花廊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.45,0:03:48.77,Na,,0,0,0,,穿过花廊   竟来到花的国度
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.91,0:03:55.15,Na,,0,0,0,,这里每绽放一个笑容
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.77,0:04:00.43,Na,,0,0,0,,便有一朵鲜花绽放的神奇国度
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.15,0:04:05.45,Na,,0,0,0,,两人小小的伟大冒险就此开始！
Comment: 0,0:06:24.00,0:06:29.00,Title,,0,0,0,,#1 VOY@GER
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.90,0:06:29.90,词曲,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}{\an4}#1 VOY@GER{\fs35}\N\N作词：乌屋茶房\N作曲：井上馨太\N编曲：井上馨太\N翻译：花椰菜牧师
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.36,0:07:10.90,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}「在这片星空的另一端
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.36,0:07:10.90,yayoi - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}「この空の向こう側には
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.90,0:07:14.35,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}会有怎样的世界在等待？」
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.90,0:07:14.35,yayoi - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}どんな世界が待ってるの？」
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.35,0:07:17.87,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}因胸口漫溢而出的心跳
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.35,0:07:17.87,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}溢れ出した胸の鼓動で
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.87,0:07:20.34,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}有此无眠之夜
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.87,0:07:20.34,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}眠れない夜に
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.49,0:07:23.73,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}向着地平线那端的远方
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.49,0:07:23.73,yayoi - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}水平線の向こうの方へ
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.00,0:07:27.50,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}试着追逐流星探出的手
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.00,0:07:27.50,yayoi - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}流星を追って伸ばした手
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.50,0:07:31.15,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}来吧  不妨就此动身奔赴前去
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.50,0:07:31.15,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}さぁ、立ち上がって走り出したら
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.15,0:07:34.50,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}与我一同踏上旅途
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.15,0:07:34.50,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}旅に出よう、私と
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.50,0:07:36.35,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}直到遥远彼方
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.50,0:07:36.35,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}遠く遠くまで
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.51,0:07:43.86,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}去追寻那道辉光吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.51,0:07:43.86,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}輝きを追いかけて
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.06,0:07:53.56,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}我将催起好奇心的灯火
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.06,0:07:53.56,yayoi - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}好奇心のライト灯して
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.56,0:07:56.98,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}巡游在与你描绘的航路
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.56,0:07:56.98,yayoi - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}君と描いた旅路をゆこう
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.98,0:08:00.47,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}跟着胸口漫溢出的心跳
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.98,0:08:00.47,yayoi - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}溢れ出した胸の鼓動の
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.47,0:08:03.16,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}乘上它的加速装置
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.47,0:08:03.16,yayoi - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}加速装置に乗って
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.16,0:08:06.06,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}星尘般浩渺的可能性中
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.16,0:08:06.06,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}星屑みたいな可能性から
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.60,0:08:10.06,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}存在着联结星座的道标
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.60,0:08:10.06,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}星座を繋いだ道標
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.06,0:08:13.45,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}一扫内心的迷惘与不安
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.06,0:08:13.45,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}迷いも不安も今はないよ
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.72,0:08:17.01,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}回首身后的辉迹
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.72,0:08:17.01,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}振り返る輝跡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.22,0:08:20.91,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}那夜空的一闪  {\t(1900,2100,\3c&HE199FD&)}此刻想来
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.22,0:08:20.91,yayoi - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}夜空の瞬き　{\t(1900,2100,\3c&HE199FD&)}今確かに
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.91,0:08:24.21,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}便是指尖飞掠过的闪光
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.91,0:08:24.21,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}指をかすめたきらめき
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.21,0:08:28.30,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}已经做好准备  {\t(1900,2100,\3c&HE199FD&)}你我一同
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.21,0:08:28.30,yayoi - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}準備はできている　{\t(1900,2100,\3c&HE199FD&)}君も私も
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.30,0:08:31.04,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}奔赴向前吧  向着更遥远的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.30,0:08:31.04,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}飛び出そうよ　さらに
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.04,0:08:34.86,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}用“闪闪发光”什么的形容还远远不够
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.04,0:08:34.86,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}キラキラなんて言葉じゃまだ足りない
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.86,0:08:37.92,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}我将变得比星星更耀眼
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.86,0:08:37.92,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}星よりももっと眩しく
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.92,0:08:43.08,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}爱将成为开辟时代与未来的那道光
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.92,0:08:43.08,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}アイは時代を未来を拓く光になる
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.08,0:08:44.97,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}终有一天实现
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.08,0:08:44.97,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}なれるから
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.97,0:08:49.67,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}请不要将你的视线移开
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.97,0:08:49.67,yayoi - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}その目を離さないで
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.67,0:08:52.10,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}与我一同前行吧  此刻
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.67,0:08:52.10,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}私と行こう、今
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.10,0:08:57.91,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}怀抱着这份无尽的愿望
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.10,0:08:57.91,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}限りない願い抱いて
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.00,0:09:13.52,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}琥珀色的唱片正在唱响
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.00,0:09:13.52,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}飴色のレコード鳴らす
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.52,0:09:16.99,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}连星星也如共鸣般摇动
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.52,0:09:16.99,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}歌うように星が揺れる
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.99,0:09:20.46,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}合着胸口漫溢出的心跳
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.99,0:09:20.46,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}溢れ出した胸の鼓動の
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.46,0:09:23.06,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}跟上它的节奏旋律
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.46,0:09:23.06,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}リズムに乗っかって
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.06,0:09:26.01,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}由木星的云带  拾级而上
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.06,0:09:26.01,yayoi - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}木星の雲　ステップ踏んで
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.54,0:09:30.04,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}以土星的晕轮  作为舞台
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.54,0:09:30.04,yayoi - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}土星の輪っか　ステージにして
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.04,0:09:33.79,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}追逐超越曾几何时见到的流星
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.04,0:09:33.79,yayoi - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}いつかみた流星を追い越して
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.79,0:09:37.04,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}正要带你一同前往
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.79,0:09:37.04,yayoi - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}君を連れてくよ
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.04,0:09:38.58,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}辉光的所在
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.04,0:09:38.58,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}輝きの先
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.20,0:10:05.82,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}We are the travelers
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.82,0:10:07.50,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}现在正从太阳系动身
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.82,0:10:07.50,yayoi - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}太陽系を今旅立つ
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.50,0:10:09.24,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}我们将化身那道光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.50,0:10:09.24,yayoi - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}僕らはそう光になる
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.24,0:10:10.79,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}让思想本身发生转变
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.24,0:10:10.79,yayoi - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}思考自体変わるぐらい
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.79,0:10:12.42,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}愿到达那耀眼的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.79,0:10:12.42,yayoi - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}まばゆい世界届けたい
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.42,0:10:14.35,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}Across the Universe
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.35,0:10:16.36,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}在星海之中开辟航路
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.35,0:10:16.36,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}星の海を切り開く
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.36,0:10:17.78,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}相信爱会在瞬息之间
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.36,0:10:17.78,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}アイがほらじきに
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.78,0:10:19.55,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}掀起全新的奇点风暴
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.78,0:10:19.55,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}巻き起こすさシンギュラリティ
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.08,0:10:23.25,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}几亿光年的遥远
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.08,0:10:23.25,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}何億光年だって
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.25,0:10:26.75,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}只要能与你同行  定能到达
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.25,0:10:26.75,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}君となら行ける、きっと
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.75,0:10:34.11,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}如此莽撞的梦想  依旧想要全部实现
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.75,0:10:34.11,yayoi - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}無謀な夢を見て、叶えたいよ全部
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.11,0:10:37.52,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}穿越银河（去往更遥远的地方）
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.11,0:10:37.52,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}銀河を超えて(もっと遠くへ)
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.52,0:10:44.14,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}比宇宙更遥远的所在
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.52,0:10:44.14,yayoi - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}宇宙を超えた先へ
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.14,0:10:47.79,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}I must go  与你见证梦想的延续
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.14,0:10:47.79,yayoi - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}I must go　君と見た夢の続き
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.84,0:10:54.82,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}I must show  陪伴着你前行的光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.84,0:10:54.82,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}I must show　君を連れて行く光
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.90,0:11:01.70,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}I must see  尚未有人涉足的前方
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.90,0:11:01.70,yayoi - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}I must see　誰もまだ知らない先
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.80,0:11:10.62,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}如果你的爱能够将我照亮的话
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.80,0:11:10.62,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}君のアイが　私を照らしてくれるなら
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.82,0:11:15.68,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}用“无限大”什么的形容还远远不够
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.82,0:11:15.68,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}無限大なんて言葉じゃまだ足りない
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.68,0:11:18.75,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}有你陪伴的话能走得更远
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.68,0:11:18.75,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}君とならもっと遠くまで
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.75,0:11:24.02,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}爱将成为突破时间与次元的那道光
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.75,0:11:24.02,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}アイは時間も次元も超える光になる
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.02,0:11:25.93,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}好好瞧着吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.02,0:11:25.93,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}見ていてね
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.93,0:11:30.46,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}与你一同去确认
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.93,0:11:30.46,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}君と確かめに行こう
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.46,0:11:32.89,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}直到辉光所在
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.46,0:11:32.89,yayoi - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}輝きの先まで
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.89,0:11:38.56,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}在无限的希望中
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.89,0:11:38.56,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}果てしない希望の中へ
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.09,0:11:46.53,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}向着地平线那端的远方
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.09,0:11:46.53,yayoi - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}水平線の向こうの方へ
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.53,0:11:50.01,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}试着追逐流星探出的手
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.53,0:11:50.01,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}流星を追って伸ばした手
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.01,0:11:53.77,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}来吧  不妨就此动身奔赴前去
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.01,0:11:53.77,yayoi - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}さぁ、立ち上がって走り出したら
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.77,0:11:56.90,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}与你一同踏上旅途
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.77,0:11:56.90,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}旅に出よう、君と
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.90,0:11:58.90,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}直到遥远彼方
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.90,0:11:58.90,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}遠く遠くまで
Comment: 0,0:12:10.00,0:12:15.00,Title,,0,0,0,,#2 99 Nights
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.65,0:12:15.65,词曲,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}{\an4}#2 99 Nights{\fs35}\N\N作词：MC TC\N作曲：Taku Inoue\N编曲：Taku Inoue\N翻译：YOU宅
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.18,0:12:35.35,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}99Nights
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.18,0:12:35.35,yayoi - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}99ナイツ
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.35,0:12:38.52,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}不断重复上演着  相遇与再见
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.35,0:12:38.52,yayoi - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}ハロー&グッバイ　繰り返してた
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.46,0:12:43.82,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}相互倾述着  暧昧不足的话语
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.46,0:12:43.82,yayoi - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}曖昧な足りない言葉　やりとりしては
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.76,0:12:49.15,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}亦或哭泣  亦或欢笑或是悲喜交错
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.76,0:12:49.15,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}泣いたり　笑ったり　すれ違ったり
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.63,0:12:54.40,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}清晨将至  装做视而不见
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.63,0:12:54.40,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}近づく朝　見ないふりして
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.34,0:13:00.21,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}若是今晚定能道出心意
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.34,0:13:00.21,yayoi - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}今夜ならばきっと言える
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.66,0:13:05.22,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}因为看到了流星
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.66,0:13:05.22,yayoi - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}流れ星を見たから
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.95,0:13:10.87,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}1在第一百天的早晨
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.95,0:13:10.87,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}100番目の朝が君を
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.29,0:13:15.54,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}你被虏获到远方之前
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.29,0:13:15.54,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}どこか遠くへさらう前に
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.74,0:13:18.07,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}99Nights
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.74,0:13:18.07,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}99ナイツ
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.07,0:13:21.85,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}想与你述说  你可曾感到过幸福
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.07,0:13:21.85,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}話したいな　幸せだったかな
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.16,0:13:26.67,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}想要见你之类的话哪怕一次也未曾说过出口
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.16,0:13:26.67,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}会いたいなんて一度だって言えなかった
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.42,0:13:30.06,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}为何闪闪星光如飘浮的高光
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.42,0:13:30.06,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}なんてスターライト　浮かぶハイライト
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.06,0:13:32.34,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}寂静的夜幕降临
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.06,0:13:32.34,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}静かな夜が来た
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.34,0:13:37.22,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}而你却仍未到来
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.34,0:13:37.22,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}君はまだ来ないね
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.85,0:13:50.00,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}Daring Daring
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.85,0:13:50.00,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}ダーリンダーリン
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.00,0:13:53.26,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}向星空为你日夜祈福
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.00,0:13:53.26,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}星空に願い続けた
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.25,0:13:58.81,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}为何总觉得明天的聚会将不会存在
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.25,0:13:58.81,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}明日にならないパーティー　ある気がしてた
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.83,0:14:05.20,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}心怀抱着不确定的期待
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.83,0:14:05.20,yayoi - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}何かに不確かな期待を抱いて
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.68,0:14:10.69,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}对到来清晨假装视而不见
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.68,0:14:10.69,yayoi - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}近づく朝見ないふりした
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.23,0:14:16.24,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}我明白的  {\t(2700,2900,\3c&H3999F3&)}也是一清二楚
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.23,0:14:16.24,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}わかってたんだ　{\t(2700,2900,\3c&H3999F3&)}知ってたんだ
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.56,0:14:21.41,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}纵使看到了流星
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.56,0:14:21.41,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}流れ星を見たって
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.03,0:14:25.42,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}在第一百天的早晨
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.03,0:14:25.42,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}100番目の朝は
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.42,0:14:32.39,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}与你共同欢笑  {\t(4600,4800,\3c&H3999F3&)}彼此分享
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.42,0:14:32.39,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}君と笑いあったり　{\t(4600,4800,\3c&H3999F3&)}分かちあったり
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.70,0:14:37.01,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}一起手牵着手  {\t(2500,2700,\3c&H726607&)}已化为泡影
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.70,0:14:37.01,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}手をつないだり{\t(2500,2700,\3c&H726607&)}できないこと
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.21,0:14:39.43,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}99Nights
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.21,0:14:39.43,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}99ナイツ
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.43,0:14:43.11,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}你我两人  还没彼此深入了解
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.43,0:14:43.11,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}二人　まだ知らないことばかり
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.52,0:14:45.97,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}在相遇之前  喜欢的颜色
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.52,0:14:45.97,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}出会う前も　好きな色も
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.97,0:14:48.20,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}和喜欢的人
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.97,0:14:48.20,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}好きな人も
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.86,0:14:51.38,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}如今不合时宜的灯光已经
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.86,0:14:51.38,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}場違いなライトアップが今
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.52,0:14:53.71,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}融为街道的路灯
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.52,0:14:53.71,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}溶けてく街灯り
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.71,0:14:58.55,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}如同流星一般
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.71,0:14:58.55,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}流れ星みたいね
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.23,0:15:22.09,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}呐  想和你述说
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.23,0:15:22.09,yayoi - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}ねえ話したいな
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.09,0:15:23.53,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}这99Nights
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.09,0:15:23.53,yayoi - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}99ナイツ
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.53,0:15:25.83,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}你可曾感到过幸福
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.53,0:15:25.83,yayoi - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}幸せだったかな
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.16,0:15:30.08,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}清晨到临
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.16,0:15:30.08,yayoi - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}朝がくる
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.81,0:15:36.33,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}对啊其实我想每时每刻都温柔地对待你
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.81,0:15:36.33,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}そう本当はいつだって優しくしたかった
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.47,0:15:44.16,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}离别也只会在梦中呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.47,0:15:44.16,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}さよならは夢の中ね
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.88,0:15:46.08,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}99Nights
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.88,0:15:46.08,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}99ナイツ
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.08,0:15:47.44,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}我不会伤心的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.08,0:15:47.44,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}泣いてないわ
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.44,0:15:49.83,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}因为时间已到  清晨来临
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.44,0:15:49.83,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}もうタイムアップ　朝だから
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.04,0:15:52.69,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}呐  听我说  那个…那个…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.04,0:15:52.69,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}ねえ聞いて　あのね　あのね
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.69,0:15:54.73,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}我喜欢你哟
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.69,0:15:54.73,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}君が好きよ
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.50,0:15:56.68,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}想传达给你
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.50,0:15:56.68,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}伝えたいな
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.68,0:15:58.21,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}希望朝阳不要到来
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.68,0:15:58.21,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}来ないでサンライズ
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.21,0:16:00.36,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}如今你已不再出现
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.21,0:16:00.36,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}今はもう君がいない
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.58,0:16:05.18,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}愿在梦中相会
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.58,0:16:05.18,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}夢の中会いたい
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.86,0:16:10.54,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}愿在梦中相会
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.86,0:16:10.54,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}夢の中会いたい
Comment: 0,0:16:20.00,0:16:25.00,Title,,0,0,0,,#3 星彩ステッパー
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.95,0:16:25.95,词曲,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}{\an4}#3 星彩ステッパー{\fs35}\N\N作词：重田佑介\N作曲：北谷光浩\N编曲：北谷光浩\N翻译：YOU宅
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.41,0:16:38.25,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}高举起雨后的伞  在云间任意绘画
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.41,0:16:38.25,yayoi - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}雨上がりの傘で　雲に絵を描いて
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.32,0:16:47.51,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}音乐装进口袋中  是时候该飞出日常了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.32,0:16:47.51,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}ポケットに音楽をつめて　外に飛び出そう
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.31,0:16:52.77,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}Ride on！  随着跳出的步伐
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.31,0:16:52.77,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}Ride on！　跳ねたステップで
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.84,0:16:57.01,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}预备跑！{\t(800,900,\3c&HE199FD&)}一起踢飞鞋子
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.84,0:16:57.01,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}よーいどん！{\t(800,900,\3c&HE199FD&)}靴けっとばせ
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.24,0:17:07.09,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}让摩擦系数降到为0  来吧　{\t(4500,4700,\3c&H726607&)}往宇宙为止  3、2、1
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.24,0:17:07.09,yayoi - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}摩擦係数は0になって　さあ　{\t(4500,4700,\3c&H726607&)}宇宙まで　3、2、1！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.09,0:17:11.37,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}自由自在地飞向  闪闪发光的星星身旁
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.09,0:17:11.37,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}キラキラと光る　星まで飛んで行こう
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.60,0:17:16.01,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}在憧憬的地方  一起拍拍手
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.60,0:17:16.01,yayoi - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}憧れた場所で　手を叩こう
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.22,0:17:20.42,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}即使是漫无目的地  在某处绕了远路
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.22,0:17:20.42,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}ふらふらどこかに　寄り道をしても
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.67,0:17:25.00,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}你也一定紧紧地  牵着我的手
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.67,0:17:25.00,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}きっと君は僕の　手をつなぐ
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.18,0:17:32.36,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}没有捷径可走  {\t(2400,2600,\3c&H3999F3&)}悠哉{\t(2800,3000,\3c&HE199FD&)}悠哉地{\3c&H726607&}一步一步  {\t(5000,5200,\3c&H3999F3&)}向前进发吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.18,0:17:32.36,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}近道はないさ　{\t(2400,2600,\3c&H3999F3&)}ふらり{\t(2800,3000,\3c&HE199FD&)}ふらり{\3c&H726607&}一歩ずつ　{\t(5000,5200,\3c&H3999F3&)}前に進もう
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.58,0:17:43.61,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}晌午过后的彩虹  在晴空间高高跃起
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.58,0:17:43.61,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}昼下がりの虹で　空に高く飛んで
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.78,0:17:52.62,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}口袋中的音乐也  开始随风起舞了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.78,0:17:52.62,yayoi - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}ポケットの音楽は　風と踊り始めた
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.83,0:17:58.41,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}Take Off！ {\t(600,800,\3c&HE199FD&)}随着跳跃的节奏
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.83,0:17:58.41,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}Take Off！ {\t(600,800,\3c&HE199FD&)}跳ねたリズムで
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.20,0:18:02.65,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}即刻出发吧！{\t(600,800,\3c&H3999F3&)}大大地吸一口空气
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.20,0:18:02.65,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}さあ行こう！{\t(600,800,\3c&H3999F3&)}空気飲みこんで
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.65,0:18:12.40,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}将心中不安一扫而空  来吧  {\3c&H726607&}展翅飞翔吧  3、2、1
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.65,0:18:12.40,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}不安なこと0になって　さあ　{\3c&H726607&}飛び立とう　3、2、1！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.61,0:18:16.75,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}在灿烂夺目的  耀眼阳光之下的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.61,0:18:16.75,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}ピカピカと光る　お日さまの下の
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.00,0:18:21.42,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}暖心之处  伸出双手吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.00,0:18:21.42,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}暖かい場所で　手を伸ばそう
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.42,0:18:25.98,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}在无数梦想彼此相连的道路上
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.42,0:18:25.98,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}夢と夢つなぐ　たくさんの道で
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.98,0:18:30.41,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}你正向我招手  来吧一起前行吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.98,0:18:30.41,yayoi - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}手招くさ君を　さあさあ歩こう
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.41,0:18:37.80,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}亲手去抓住明天  {\t(2400,2600,\3c&HE199FD&)}悠悠{\t(2800,3000,\3c&H3999F3&)}然然地{\3c&H726607&}一步一步  {\t(5000,5200,\3c&HE199FD&)}向前进发吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.41,0:18:37.80,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}明日に手をかけて　{\t(2400,2600,\3c&HE199FD&}ゆらり{\t(2800,3000,\3c&H3999F3&}ゆらり{\3c&H726607&}一歩ずつ　{\t(5000,5200,\3c&HE199FD&}前に進もう
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.50,0:18:50.94,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}云层之下正看见
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.50,0:18:50.94,yayoi - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}雲の下に見える
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.10,0:18:55.29,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}我们穿过熟悉的街道
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.10,0:18:55.29,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}僕らの街こえて
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.20,0:18:59.94,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}你我共同所歌唱的旋律
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.20,0:18:59.94,yayoi - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}君と僕で　歌うメロディー
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.10,0:19:04.03,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}一起奏唱吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.10,0:19:04.03,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}奏でよう！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.01,0:19:14.86,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}总算是走到了  比想象要远的地方呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.01,0:19:14.86,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}随分遠くまで来てしまったね
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.21,0:19:29.15,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}然而我们  {\t(4000,4200,\3c&HE199FD&)}如过去那样笑容依旧  {\t(6600,6800,\3c&H726607&)}没有一丝的变化与伙伴们一起
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.21,0:19:29.15,yayoi - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}でも僕たちは　{\t(4000,4200,\3c&HE199FD&)}昔みたいに笑って　{\t(6600,6800,\3c&H726607&)}何にも変わらない仲間と一緒に
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.15,0:19:33.53,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}自由自在地飞向  闪闪发光的星星身旁
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.15,0:19:33.53,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}キラキラと光る　星まで飛んで行こう
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.53,0:19:38.01,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}在圆梦的地方  一起拍拍手
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.53,0:19:38.01,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}夢叶う場所で　手を叩こう
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.01,0:19:42.56,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}即使是漫无目的地  在某地了迷失方向
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.01,0:19:42.56,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}ふらふらどこかで　はぐれてしまっても
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.56,0:19:47.05,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}我便悄悄地将你的  手牵在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.56,0:19:47.05,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}そっと僕は君の　手をつなごう
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.22,0:19:59.06,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}这是无尽的旅途  {\t(2400,2600,\3c&H3999F3&)}一直地一直地{\t(3400,3600,\3c&HE199FD&)}永远永远{\3c&H726607&}一步接一步  一同向前进吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.22,0:19:59.06,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}終わりない旅さ　{\t(2400,2600,\3c&H3999F3&)}いつもいつも{\t(3400,3600,\3c&HE199FD&)}ずっとずっと{\3c&H726607&}一歩ずつ　前に進もう
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.83,0:20:08.33,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}没有捷径可走  永无止尽的旅程
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.83,0:20:08.33,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}近道はないさ　終わりない旅さ
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.82,0:20:17.41,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}没有捷径可走  永无止尽的旅程
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.82,0:20:17.41,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}近道はないさ　終わりない旅さ
Comment: 0,0:20:33.00,0:20:38.00,Title,,0,0,0,,MC1
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.32,0:20:36.64,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}哇  伊织你快看呀
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.10,0:20:40.46,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}好大一片花海呀
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.70,0:20:47.80,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}真的耶  就连星空都在闪耀着  真的好美啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.52,0:20:52.64,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}我说伊织  要是我们一起对着花儿吹气
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.76,0:20:56.23,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}花儿会不会摇曳得更美呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.86,0:20:59.16,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}听起来好有趣  我们来试试看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.92,0:21:03.54,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}那准备好咯弥生   一   二   三
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.98,0:21:18.56,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}花儿比之前摇曳得都厉害  真是太美了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.32,0:21:23.46,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}真的欸  这些花儿就像有生命一样
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.03,0:21:35.82,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}伊织 我们今天就在这儿聊个痛快吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.70,0:21:41.40,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}好呀！ 一边看星星一边和弥生聊天
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.69,0:21:43.36,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}说不定聊着聊着就天亮啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.07,0:21:46.38,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}所以呢——
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.04,0:21:51.66,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}今天是弥生和伊织的双人演唱会
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.98,0:21:59.76,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5\pos(560,1060)}「永远好朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.17,0:21:59.76,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}和你聊不停」公演
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.56,0:21:59.76,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5\pos(1328,1060)}现在开始！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.42,0:22:07.76,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}首先从自我介绍开始哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.63,0:22:10.92,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}大家晚上好——！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.08,0:22:16.54,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}我是水濑伊织
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.26,0:22:22.34,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}今晚的演出我要和弥生一起闪闪发光
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.34,0:22:24.54,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}让大家看到可爱的伊织
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.95,0:22:26.25,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}请多关照！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.06,0:22:30.26,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}接下来轮到弥生啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.61,0:22:33.60,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}到！我是高槻弥生！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.22,0:22:37.96,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}因为是最后一场演出 我要不留遗憾
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.17,0:22:41.34,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}要让大家都笑容满面元气满满
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.68,0:22:44.00,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}我会拼命努力的！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.56,0:22:46.95,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}请多关照！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.82,0:22:55.52,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}观看直播的大家也请多关照！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.60,0:23:00.62,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}伊织 这次
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.62,0:23:04.80,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}「永远都是好朋友 和你聊不停」公演
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.80,0:23:07.00,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}演出就要结束了呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.28,0:23:13.32,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}是啊 演唱会总是转眼就结束了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.33,0:23:17.78,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}嗯…准备了这么多 演出却要结束了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.78,0:23:19.36,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}虽然有点舍不得
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.33,0:23:25.07,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}但正因为要结束了 我们更要尽情享受！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.07,0:23:29.27,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}来吧！让我们尽情享受直到最后一刻！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.71,0:23:35.68,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}话说回来 演唱会开场时播放的故事
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.68,0:23:38.34,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}和以往有些不同呢
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.80,0:23:41.67,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}会是什么样的结局呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.15,0:23:45.86,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}以往的演唱会也都是以故事为主题
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.86,0:23:47.60,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}来编排歌单的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.83,0:23:53.44,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}这次会如何安排当然值得期待
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.14,0:23:56.90,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}注定会是个幸福美满的结局！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.24,0:24:01.34,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}毕竟是我和伊织嘛！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.69,0:24:06.15,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}所以各位 请和我们一起
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.15,0:24:09.72,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}尽情享受 为我们加油吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.00,0:24:19.02,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}伊织 昨天演唱会上
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.02,0:24:22.90,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}大家高声呼喊我的名字
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.90,0:24:26.02,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}让我特别开心！既然是最后一场演出
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.27,0:24:28.71,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}好想再体验一次呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.66,0:24:34.82,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}不错的主意！不过完全重复就太无趣了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.33,0:24:37.56,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}我们来场应援对决怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.87,0:24:40.20,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}哇 有意思！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.42,0:24:46.06,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}那就这样  中间到右侧的各位就是小兔队！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.77,0:24:50.62,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}左侧的朋友们就是青蛙队！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.24,0:24:53.04,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}大家准备好了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.52,0:24:57.58,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}先从小兔队开始！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.27,0:25:02.06,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}请大家大声喊出我的名字！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.70,0:25:06.53,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}要开始啦！预备——！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.72,0:25:10.76,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}好——！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.69,0:25:14.66,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}小兔子队的声音真响亮！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.79,0:25:18.32,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}接下来轮到青蛙队！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.73,0:25:21.10,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}为了不输给小兔队
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.38,0:25:25.31,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}请大家也大声喊出我的名字！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.82,0:25:29.44,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}要开始啦——！预备——！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.12,0:25:38.10,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}好——！太棒了——！这么热烈的欢呼声
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.10,0:25:40.20,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}谢谢大家！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.83,0:25:46.52,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}伊织 小兔子队和小青蛙队  到底哪边赢了呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.03,0:25:50.32,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}嗯—— 这还真难判断呢
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.96,0:25:55.16,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}因为两边声音都很大  实在分不出胜负
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.48,0:25:58.48,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}那就算是平局？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.74,0:26:01.74,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}不行  我们来加赛一轮！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.22,0:26:07.26,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}这次我和弥生要同时来！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.02,0:26:11.24,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}不分队伍了  大家随意选择
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.45,0:26:12.92,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}一起来喊我们的名字！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.50,0:26:17.36,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}大家一起  预备——起！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.85,0:26:24.80,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}好嘞——！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.68,0:26:29.54,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}果然啊  要说谁更胜一筹的话
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.54,0:26:30.94,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}根本分不出胜负嘛！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.90,0:26:34.60,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}那就当大家都赢啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.18,0:26:42.34,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}像这样和大家一起享受欢乐时光
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.65,0:26:44.38,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}都快到天亮了！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.31,0:26:46.24,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}这可不行！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.75,0:26:49.42,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}那就让我们乘着这股劲头
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.57,0:26:52.18,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}一起来听下一首歌吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.54,0:26:53.76,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}接下来要带来的歌曲是——
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.17,0:26:55.39,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}就是这首！
