Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.40,0:27:06.79,yayoi - jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}{\fad(120,100)}オハヨ　SUN SUN SUN
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.79,0:27:08.10,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}{\fad(120,100)}早上好  SUN SUN SUN
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.79,0:27:08.10,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}{\fad(120,100)}オハヨ　SUN SUN SUN
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.10,0:27:11.01,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}{\fad(120,100)}早上好  SUN SUN SUN  {\t(1800,2000,\3c&H726607&)}Sunshine
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.10,0:27:11.01,yayoi - jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}{\fad(120,100)}オハヨ　SUN SUN SUN　{\t(1800,2000,\3c&H726607&)}サンシャイン
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.51,0:27:27.32,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}{\fad(120,100)}透过窗户缝隙  照射进来的
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.51,0:27:27.32,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}{\fad(120,100)}カーテンの隙间　差し込んでる
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.94,0:27:32.86,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}{\fad(120,100)}光线真是耀眼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.94,0:27:32.86,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}{\fad(120,100)}光のラインが眩しいね
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.49,0:27:38.76,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}{\fad(120,100)}就像站在舞台上方（上方）
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.49,0:27:38.76,yayoi - jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}{\fad(120,100)}まるでステージの上を（上を）
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.03,0:27:43.97,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}{\fad(120,100)}被聚光灯照射着那样（那样）
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.03,0:27:43.97,yayoi - jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}{\fad(120,100)}照らすスポットライトみたいに（みたいに）
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.97,0:27:51.89,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}{\fad(120,100)}{\t(1300,1500,\3c&H3999F3&)}明亮的{\3c&HE199FD&}温柔的将一切{\t(4500,4700,\3c&H726607&)}包裹
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.97,0:27:51.89,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}{\fad(120,100)}全てを　{\t(1300,1500,\3c&H3999F3&)}明るく　{\3c&HE199FD&}优しく　{\t(4500,4700,\3c&H726607&)}包みこんだら
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.07,0:27:57.60,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}{\fad(120,100)}GOOD MORNING  崭新的一天你看
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.07,0:27:57.60,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}{\fad(120,100)}GOOD-MORNING　新しい一日がほら
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.72,0:28:00.32,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}{\fad(120,100)}{\3c&H3999F3&}睁开眼睛  {\t(1300,1500,\3c&HE199FD&)}大声说出
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.72,0:28:00.32,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}{\fad(120,100)}{\3c&H3999F3&}目を覚まして　{\t(1300,1500,\3c&HE199FD&)}声を出して
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.45,0:28:03.02,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}{\fad(120,100)}准备开始
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.45,0:28:03.02,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}{\fad(120,100)}始まろうとしてる
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.26,0:28:07.82,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}{\fad(120,100)}我们要去哪？  我们该做什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.26,0:28:07.82,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}{\fad(120,100)}どこへ行こうか？　何しようか？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.01,0:28:11.36,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}{\fad(120,100)}真是令人兴奋不已的  GOOD MORNING
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.01,0:28:11.36,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}{\fad(120,100)}ワクワクしちゃうね　GOOD-MORNING
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.36,0:28:12.68,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}{\fad(120,100)}早上好  SUN SUN SUN
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.36,0:28:12.68,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}{\fad(120,100)}オハヨ　SUN SUN SUN
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.68,0:28:14.04,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}{\fad(120,100)}早上好  SUN SUN SUN
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.68,0:28:14.04,yayoi - jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}{\fad(120,100)}オハヨ　SUN SUN SUN
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.04,0:28:16.81,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}{\fad(120,100)}早上好  SUN SUN SUN  {\t(1800,2000,\3c&H726607&)}Sunshine
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.04,0:28:16.81,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}{\fad(120,100)}オハヨ　SUN SUN SUN　{\t(1800,2000,\3c&H726607&)}サンシャイン
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.33,0:28:33.37,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}{\fad(120,100)}睁眼醒来一脚踢飞闹钟
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.33,0:28:33.37,yayoi - jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}{\fad(120,100)}目覚まし时计を蹴飞ばしたら
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.80,0:28:38.69,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}{\fad(120,100)}急忙穿好衣服飞奔而出
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.80,0:28:38.69,yayoi - jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}{\fad(120,100)}急いで着替えて飞び出そう
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.34,0:28:44.84,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}{\fad(120,100)}总感觉有与昨天不同的
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.34,0:28:44.84,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}{\fad(120,100)}昨日と违う何かが
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.84,0:28:49.81,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}{\fad(120,100)}新的经历在等待着我
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.84,0:28:49.81,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}{\fad(120,100)}きっと待ってる気がする
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.81,0:28:58.10,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}{\fad(120,100)}大大地{\t(1000,1200,\3c&HE199FD&)}深呼吸  {\3c&H3999F3&}心情{\t(4700,4900,\3c&H726607&)}舒畅  元气满满
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.81,0:28:58.10,yayoi - jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}{\fad(120,100)}大きく{\t(1000,1200,\3c&HE199FD&)}深呼吸　{\3c&H3999F3&}心は{\t(4700,4900,\3c&H726607&)}晴れ晴れ　ゲンキ
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.44,0:29:25.90,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}{\fad(120,100)}独自一人经历的早晨也好（早晨也好）
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.44,0:29:25.90,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}{\fad(120,100)}ひとりぼっちの朝も（朝も）
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.90,0:29:31.02,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}{\fad(120,100)}大家一起度过的早晨也好（早晨也好）
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.90,0:29:31.02,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}{\fad(120,100)}みんなと一绪の朝も（朝も）
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.02,0:29:39.57,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}{\fad(120,100)}用不变的笑容去传达光芒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.02,0:29:39.57,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}{\fad(120,100)}変わらない笑顔で光を届けてくれる
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.78,0:29:42.68,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}{\fad(120,100)}早·上·好
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.78,0:29:42.68,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}{\fad(120,100)}オ・ハ・ヨ
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.43,0:29:48.77,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}{\fad(120,100)}GOOD MORNING  崭新的一天你看
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.43,0:29:48.77,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}{\fad(120,100)}GOOD-MORNING　新しい一日がほら
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.77,0:29:54.36,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}{\fad(120,100)}睁开眼睛  大声说出  准备开始
