Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.14,0:37:19.80,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}Get you···ずっと···
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.52,0:37:36.68,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}嗯···
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.52,0:37:36.68,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}う～ん···
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.68,0:37:43.20,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}穿哪件泳衣比较好呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.68,0:37:43.20,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}どんな水着いいのよ？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.56,0:37:48.93,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}就穿你喜欢的那件吧···
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.56,0:37:48.93,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}好きなの着てあげる···
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.93,0:37:49.99,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}C'mon！
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.08,0:37:54.64,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}别那样看着我
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.08,0:37:54.64,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}そんな見ないで
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.05,0:37:57.91,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}我的心会爆炸的
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.05,0:37:57.91,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}胸が弾けそう
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.81,0:38:05.05,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}我可不想暴露喜欢你的事实啊！！
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.81,0:38:05.05,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}好きな事はバレちゃイヤ！！
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.25,0:38:06.30,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}L'isola
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.25,0:38:06.30,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}リゾラ
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.52,0:38:09.18,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}已经忍耐不下去
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.52,0:38:09.18,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}もう止まらない
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.18,0:38:12.95,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}虽然真的很想说出口
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.18,0:38:12.95,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}本当は言いたいけど
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.95,0:38:13.69,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}L'isola
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.95,0:38:13.69,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}リゾラ
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.69,0:38:16.75,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}但是绝对要让你
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.69,0:38:16.75,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}絶対あなたに
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.75,0:38:20.65,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}先对我告白
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.75,0:38:20.65,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}告白させてみせる
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.77,0:38:28.06,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}Get me···可以哦···
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.77,0:38:28.06,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}Get me···いいよ···
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.30,0:38:35.98,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}Get me···可以吗···
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.30,0:38:35.98,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}Get me···いいの···
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.02,0:38:54.83,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}瓶子里装着满满的“我爱你”
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.02,0:38:54.83,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}瓶に詰めた　I LOVE YOU
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.83,0:38:58.67,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}让浪花悄悄地运送
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.83,0:38:58.67,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}そっと波が運んだ
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.67,0:39:02.50,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}希望有朝一日能够到达
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.67,0:39:02.50,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}いつか未来のあなたへ
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.50,0:39:06.27,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}未来的你身边
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.50,0:39:06.27,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}届く時が来るように···
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.27,0:39:06.99,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}L'isola
