Dialogue: 0,1:20:51.22,1:20:55.29,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}かたちにならない気持ち
Dialogue: 0,1:20:55.56,1:20:59.69,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}像温柔的雨点
